re,  we get\n\n$$\n(-13)÷(-5)=\\frac{13}{5}.\n$$"} :step/id #uuid "1dbe9819-43f5-518d-a9b8-11c1b1c0c27e" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186531687}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186531687 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186531618 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c26020cd-5995-5bd2-a2b4-8eaebe5474f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531274}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186531274} :answer-field/id #uuid "2ebf7007-b58c-5e48-a18e-e666efc3182d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531423}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "89a1fe1c-2eda-5608-9d61-d01a69e48b0c" :question/math-academy-id "q-181155" :question/problem "$56÷(-8)=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We have to divide a positive number $(56)$ by a negative one $(-8).$ So the result will be negative:\n\n$$\n56÷(-8)=-\\boxed{}\n$$\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $56$ by $8$ without any signs: $56÷8=7.$ Therefore, we get\n\n$$\n56÷(-8)=-7.\n$$"} :step/id #uuid "47ddd019-6afb-5fb1-8a27-b237d9c7ae8d" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186531726}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186531726 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186531629 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cc44ad1b-e88c-5ee0-aca5-f83f22e48da8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531290}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186531290} :answer-field/id #uuid "9e0f052d-ac29-50ab-ad2e-f3daa96494b5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531494}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "aa0a4c98-4d7d-54fc-bc9e-2776a355d7bb" :question/math-academy-id "q-181157" :question/problem "$80÷(-20)=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We have to di